<title>CZECH REPUBLIC: Czech STC Energeticka 1996 profit dips.</title>
<headline>Czech STC Energeticka 1996 profit dips.</headline>
<dateline>PRAGUE 1997-02-28</dateline>
<text>
<p>The Czech power distributor Stredoceska Energeticka (STC) said on Friday its 1996 after-tax profit dipped to 203 million crowns from 219 million in the previous year.</p>
<p> net profit (czk million)     203.375   vs    218.936</p>
<p> gross profit		 301.075   vs    421.138</p>
<p> operating profit	     n/a     vs    531.765</p>
<p> writeoffs			n/a     vs    330.759</p>
<p> assets		     9,318.909   vs  8,095.768</p>
<p>Note. Figures are still subject to external audit.</p>
<p>-- Prague Newsroom, 42-2-2423-0003</p>
</text>
